---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — ShiftCal"
  description="Contact ShiftCal: report a rotation discrepancy, request a department calendar, or suggest a new shift pattern or tool."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>
    ShiftCal gets better through exactly three kinds of email — and all three are genuinely
    welcome:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Discrepancy reports.</strong> If a calendar here disagrees with your department's
      official schedule, say which page, which date, and what the official calendar shows. These
      get fixed first.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Department requests.</strong> Want your department pre-anchored like Houston Fire or
      LA County? Send a link to the officially published rotation or calendar PDF — that is all
      that is needed to add a page.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Pattern and tool suggestions.</strong> Working a rotation that is not covered, or
      wishing for a calculator that does not exist yet? Describe it.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Email: <a href="mailto:yang486741@gmail.com">yang486741@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    <small>
      (Replies typically within a few days. Please do not include sensitive personal or payroll
      information in email — a pattern name and dates are all that is ever needed.)
    </small>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
